{"speciesId":274,"names":{"fr":"Pifeuil","es":"Nuzleaf","en":"Nuzleaf","ja":"コノハナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"NUZLEAF live in densely overgrown forests. They occasionally venture out of the forest to startle people. This POKéMON dislikes having its long nose pinched."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"This POKéMON pulls out the leaf on its head and makes a flute with it. The sound of NUZLEAF’s flute strikes fear and uncertainty in the hearts of people lost in a forest."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A forest-dwelling POKéMON that is skilled at climbing trees. Its long and pointed nose is its weak point. It loses power if the nose is gripped."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"They live in holes bored in large trees. The sound of NUZLEAF’s grass flute fills listeners with dread."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"They live in holes bored in large trees. The sound of NUZLEAF’s grass flute fills listeners with dread."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It lives deep in forests. With the leaf on its head, it makes a flute whose song makes listeners uneasy."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It lives deep in forests. With the leaf on its head, it makes a flute whose song makes listeners uneasy."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Le son de sa flûte d’herbe déstabilise l’auditeur. Il vit au plus profond des forêts."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le son de sa flûte d’herbe déstabilise l’auditeur. Il vit au plus profond des forêts."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Le son de sa flûte d’herbe déstabilise l’auditeur. Il vit au plus profond des forêts."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando usa la hoja de su cabeza como flauta, asusta a la gente. Vive en lo más profundo de los bosques."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"コノハナが 奏でる 草笛の 音色は 人を 不安にさせる。 森の 奥に 住んでいる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vit au plus profond des forêts. Le son de sa flûte, faite avec la feuille de sa tête, est inquiétant."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive en lo más profundo del bosque. Utiliza la hoja de su cabeza como flauta con un sonido perturbador."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lives deep in forests. With the leaf on its head, it makes a flute whose song makes listeners uneasy."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"森の 奥深くに 生息。 頭の 葉っぱで 笛を 作り 不安に させる 音色を 出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les Pifeuil vivent dans des forêts très densément boisées. Il leur arrive de sortir de la forêt pour faire peur aux gens. Ce Pokémon déteste qu’on lui pince son grand nez."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nuzleaf habita bosques muy poblados y, en ocasiones, se atreve a salir para asustar a la gente. A este Pokémon no le gusta nada que le pellizquen la nariz."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nuzleaf live in densely overgrown forests. They occasionally venture out of the forest to startle people. This Pokémon dislikes having its long nose pinched."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"うっそうと 茂った 森に すむ ポケモン。 たまに 森を 出ては 人を 驚かせる。 長い 鼻を つかまれるのは 大嫌い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ce Pokémon se sert de la feuille sur sa tête pour jouer de la flûte. Le son de la flûte de Pifeuil effraie et décontenance les gens perdus en forêt."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Nuzleaf saca la hoja que tiene en la cabeza y la usa como flauta. El sonido que emite infunde miedo e incertidumbre a quien se encuentre perdido por el bosque."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"This Pokémon pulls out the leaf on its head and makes a flute with it. The sound of Nuzleaf’s flute strikes fear and uncertainty in the hearts of people lost in a forest."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"頭の 葉っぱを 抜いて 草笛を つくる。 コノハナが 奏でる 草笛の 音色は 森で 迷った 人を 不安にさせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il vit au plus profond des forêts. Sa flûte faite avec la feuille de sa tête émet un son inquiétant."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Vive en lo más profundo del bosque. Utiliza la hoja de la cabeza como flauta para emitir un sonido perturbador."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It lives deep in forests. With the leaf on its head, it makes a flute whose song makes listeners uneasy."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"森の 奥深くに 生息。 頭の 葉っぱで 笛を 作り 不安に させる 音色を 出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il vit dans les trous des grands arbres. Le sifflement qu’il produit avec sa feuille suffit à remplir ses adversaires d’effroi."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Vive en las oquedades de los árboles grandes. El sonido que emite al usar la hoja de la cabeza como flauta asusta a quienes lo escuchan."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"They live in holes bored in large trees. The sound of Nuzleaf’s grass flute fills listeners with dread."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"コノハナの 吹く 草笛の 音は 聞いた ものを 不安に させる。 大木に 開いた 穴で 暮らす。"}],"varieties":[{"id":274,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"razor-wind","learns":[[5,"level-up",37],[6,"level-up",37],[7,"level-up",37],[8,"level-up",37],[9,"level-up",37],[10,"level-up",37],[11,"level-up",37],[12,"level-up",37],[13,"level-up",37],[14,"level-up",37],[15,"level-up",37],[16,"level-up",20],[17,"level-up",20],[18,"level-up",20]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"